        Root cause:
        The bug was caused by a lack of thread safety in the handling of lazily loaded plugins, where one thread could create a plugin instance while another thread could attempt to close it, leading to potential race conditions and improper resource management. This could result in instances not being closed correctly, which may lead to resource leaks or inconsistent states in the application.

        Commit message:
        SOLR-7259: fix thread safety of lazy loaded plugins

